For Radeon GPUs on Ubuntu, see the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/radeon/en/latest/docs/install/native_linux/install-radeon.html"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \ul Linux install guide for Radeon software}}\
\ls9\ilvl2\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9642 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
For Radeon GPUs on WSL, see the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/radeon/en/latest/docs/install/wsl/install-radeon.html"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \ul WSL install guide for Radeon software}}\
